    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/mz_gGMlbrsWBKdkIu06fyDZjEBO1DhMUgtQd3ofUpGY.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>If $V_B=2 V$<br/>Point A is instantaneous center of rotation<br/>Given $V_B=8 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}$<br/>$\\begin{aligned}<br/>& \\mathrm{V}=4 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{~V}_{\\mathrm{p}}=\\sqrt{2} \\mathrm{v} \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{~V}_{\\mathrm{p}}=4 \\sqrt{2} \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s} \\\\\n& \\operatorname{correct}(1)<br/>\\end{aligned}$",
